E_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"结合"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E = \\frac{1}{2} E_{k0} = 10.2 eV"},{"type":"text","value":",\n求得："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}=-13.6eV"},{"type":"text","value":"对于"},{"type":"math","value":"He^{+}"},{"type":"text","value":":"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}' = 4E_{1} = -54.4eV"},{"type":"text","value":"因此：基态"},{"type":"math","value":"He^{+}"},{"type":"text","value":"变成"},{"type":"math","value":"He^{2+}"},{"type":"text","value":"至少所需的电离能 54.4eV\n(1 分)(答案无单位不得分)\n（注：★以上各步用其他方法解题的，只要合理，得同样的分）"}]}}]}
